{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NAMAKORIUM is a chaotic, cooperative multiplayer RTS for up to four players.<br>Command the &quot;sea cleaners&quot;\u2014Namakos (sea cucumbers) left behind by humanity\u2014and clean up the polluted oceans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/c015cd7c709039b957cb672d805cc085.poster.avif?t=1760079012\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/c015cd7c709039b957cb672d805cc085.webm?t=1760079012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/c015cd7c709039b957cb672d805cc085.mp4?t=1760079012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you reclaim the beautiful sea?<br>It\u2019s all up to your planning skills, your friends, and your trusty sea cucumbers.<br>Get ready for a frantic, action-packed ocean cleanup operation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Organize Your Namako Operation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command unique Namakos, gather resources, construct buildings, and clear paths\u2014the tasks are many and time is short.<br>Purify all the pollution before the food runs out!<br>Will your strategy hold up under pressure and succeed with the team?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/d190327ffce1aad3c9d7d1127c8d5362.poster.avif?t=1760079012\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/d190327ffce1aad3c9d7d1127c8d5362.webm?t=1760079012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/d190327ffce1aad3c9d7d1127c8d5362.mp4?t=1760079012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Namakos with Special Traits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shell Namako gathers limestone. Iron Namako is great at mining. Flame Namako and Ice Namako can survive extreme temperatures.<br>Use their distinct abilities to assign roles and conquer each stage together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/397c5cde778c06561d615423330c3789.poster.avif?t=1760079012\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/397c5cde778c06561d615423330c3789.webm?t=1760079012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/397c5cde778c06561d615423330c3789.mp4?t=1760079012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore the Ocean\u2019s Beauty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you decontaminate, corals bloom, sunlight shines through, and the ocean regains vibrant color.<br>Over 40 types of &quot;Scenic Creatures&quot; will begin to swim in\u2014try to collect them all as you heal the seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/3545ce50fbdfb601445d7ed972708cbc.poster.avif?t=1760079012\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/3545ce50fbdfb601445d7ed972708cbc.webm?t=1760079012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/3545ce50fbdfb601445d7ed972708cbc.mp4?t=1760079012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beware the \u201cBlight Namako\u201d!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During cleanup, corrupted Namako known as &quot;Blight Namako&quot; may suddenly appear.<br>They rot your food and drag the ocean back into darkness.<br>Team up and repel them with the mighty Namako Fusion Cannon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/36d705b31ded4bba97a6d1eb19ca38c3.poster.avif?t=1760079012\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/36d705b31ded4bba97a6d1eb19ca38c3.webm?t=1760079012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/36d705b31ded4bba97a6d1eb19ca38c3.mp4?t=1760079012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planning x RTS Gameplay: Strategize based on map structure and control multiple cucumbers simultaneously</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic Cooperative Play: Plans may succeed... or hilariously fail\u2014every match brings its own story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer: Join with friends or random players via &quot;Friend Match&quot; or &quot;Random Match&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 Scenic Creatures: Discover real and fantasy species as you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Unique Stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage Titles Based on Clear Time</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable Sea Cucumbers &amp; a Hidden Post-Apocalyptic Worldview</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More stages, gimmicks, and creatures are planned in future updates!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guidelines for Streaming and Video Posting</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and Video Posting: OK (Very welcome!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization: OK</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prohibited Streaming Areas: None</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you could include a link to your Steam store page in the description.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866920?t=1760079012","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/96f5de646844fbba1653ae40a434a082200f2273/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760079012","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/d172b1de950c768ec2c544e2e044ace53498b249/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760079012","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/d172b1de950c768ec2c544e2e044ace53498b249/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760079012","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NAMAKORIUM is a chaotic, cooperative multiplayer RTS for up to four players.<br>Command the &quot;sea cleaners&quot;\u2014Namakos (sea cucumbers) left behind by humanity\u2014and clean up the polluted oceans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/c015cd7c709039b957cb672d805cc085.poster.avif?t=1760079012\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/c015cd7c709039b957cb672d805cc085.webm?t=1760079012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/c015cd7c709039b957cb672d805cc085.mp4?t=1760079012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you reclaim the beautiful sea?<br>It\u2019s all up to your planning skills, your friends, and your trusty sea cucumbers.<br>Get ready for a frantic, action-packed ocean cleanup operation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Organize Your Namako Operation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command unique Namakos, gather resources, construct buildings, and clear paths\u2014the tasks are many and time is short.<br>Purify all the pollution before the food runs out!<br>Will your strategy hold up under pressure and succeed with the team?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/d190327ffce1aad3c9d7d1127c8d5362.poster.avif?t=1760079012\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/d190327ffce1aad3c9d7d1127c8d5362.webm?t=1760079012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/d190327ffce1aad3c9d7d1127c8d5362.mp4?t=1760079012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Namakos with Special Traits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shell Namako gathers limestone. Iron Namako is great at mining. Flame Namako and Ice Namako can survive extreme temperatures.<br>Use their distinct abilities to assign roles and conquer each stage together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/397c5cde778c06561d615423330c3789.poster.avif?t=1760079012\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/397c5cde778c06561d615423330c3789.webm?t=1760079012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/397c5cde778c06561d615423330c3789.mp4?t=1760079012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore the Ocean\u2019s Beauty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you decontaminate, corals bloom, sunlight shines through, and the ocean regains vibrant color.<br>Over 40 types of &quot;Scenic Creatures&quot; will begin to swim in\u2014try to collect them all as you heal the seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/3545ce50fbdfb601445d7ed972708cbc.poster.avif?t=1760079012\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/3545ce50fbdfb601445d7ed972708cbc.webm?t=1760079012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/3545ce50fbdfb601445d7ed972708cbc.mp4?t=1760079012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beware the \u201cBlight Namako\u201d!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During cleanup, corrupted Namako known as &quot;Blight Namako&quot; may suddenly appear.<br>They rot your food and drag the ocean back into darkness.<br>Team up and repel them with the mighty Namako Fusion Cannon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/36d705b31ded4bba97a6d1eb19ca38c3.poster.avif?t=1760079012\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/36d705b31ded4bba97a6d1eb19ca38c3.webm?t=1760079012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/36d705b31ded4bba97a6d1eb19ca38c3.mp4?t=1760079012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planning x RTS Gameplay: Strategize based on map structure and control multiple cucumbers simultaneously</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic Cooperative Play: Plans may succeed... or hilariously fail\u2014every match brings its own story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer: Join with friends or random players via &quot;Friend Match&quot; or &quot;Random Match&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 Scenic Creatures: Discover real and fantasy species as you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Unique Stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage Titles Based on Clear Time</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable Sea Cucumbers &amp; a Hidden Post-Apocalyptic Worldview</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More stages, gimmicks, and creatures are planned in future updates!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guidelines for Streaming and Video Posting</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and Video Posting: OK (Very welcome!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization: OK</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prohibited Streaming Areas: None</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you could include a link to your Steam store page in the description.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Polyscape Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/21ea604d38cb9d0577399f21637f6be1b653212